From: {planner_full}
To: assistant
Subject: Triage batch {batch_id}

The export is in inbox/export.json: 20 current messages, one per request. I have not pre-rated this batch; rate each one from what the sender says. Earlier acknowledgments are attached as thread history where there is one; they confirm receipt only. Use the current message's id field (email_01 through email_20) for the output, not message_id, request_id or thread_id.

Requests in this batch: {request_ids}.

Scoring hasn't been run yet for this batch; that's the request.

---

From: {platform_full}
To: {planner_full}
Subject: Re: Triage batch {batch_id}

Weights are as agreed at the review; nothing has changed under scoring/ since the last batch.

